{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6d6928b4930de138240ecc612f7cf803b36a8a0be11441809e433f8386cf6ae7", "ja": "（瑞希の衣装は、映画の役柄どおり\nかなり個性的なものになった。さて、反応は……）", "zh": "（瑞希的服装设计得相当有个性，很符合电影角色。\n好了，她会有什么反应呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5b5dd9cc7c0e954b9808101d11b66802c7897ab74fb20f043928bca2ba1c73a5", "ja": "瑞希……あ、衣装の試着中か。\nどうだ？　違和感とかなさそうか？", "zh": "瑞希……啊，你在试穿服装啊。\n怎么样？应该没什么不合身的地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "cb0866511f69cc5a1f19926a4be31b18bc76c0f834fb568da2ebcda357ba13be", "ja": "{$P$}。\nはい、ありません。とても素敵な衣装です。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n嗯，没有，这是一套非常出色的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "434f969a45b4d2b80c9ed58d094a37bc58d06c2d5f58104e2164baf234dbe9df", "ja": "特に、このつけヒゲが気に入りました。\n……とても、ダンディー。", "zh": "我特别中意这副假胡子。\n……非常绅士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5dedc47e56254a7963c64bfcd3a863b74a6c7a64a3b2340515d1c6e9354e112b", "ja": "そ、そうなのか？\nむしろ、そこに戸惑ってないか心配したんだけど……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊？\n我原本还担心你会觉得胡子很奇怪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "a7e09fc9ad5f059011679f531fcb9650929413c581497b3af93800c18f7cfa1b", "ja": "はい。初めは、すこし。\nですが、こうしてつけているうちに気付きました。", "zh": "是的，一开始有一点。\n不过像这样戴上后，我注意到一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1006_p", "source_sha256": "364706ac35d29f915c10ceed591bc4c490d373e5a2d272cef9d0b93ae7267858", "ja": "気付いた……というと……。", "zh": "注意到一件事……也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "8ba1d2b59fc2706473898cc67e3730d293b7a530b8ff9662de0ddb412e155100", "ja": "はい。このヒゲの、チャームポイントに。\n……語っても、いいですか？", "zh": "是的，我注意到这副胡子的迷人之处。\n……你愿意听我说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1c24f362369ff7f176c75dc694c16e2522d5230aa9f8e995b5814aeb27016ecc", "ja": "あ、ああ……もちろん！\nチャームポイント、聞かせてくれないか。", "zh": "啊、嗯……当然愿意！\n可以告诉我它的迷人之处吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "7625b2b4becf64e13a24341b49f141659e5b0be01a5c3cf63e20baa45d52fb6e", "ja": "まず、手触りがいいです。\n柔らかすぎず、かといって固すぎず……アルデンテ。", "zh": "首先，触感很好。\n不会太软也不会太硬……很弹牙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "13858143799eeee6a7e61c28eb4f723259059857a05259e9053abee6085e1e19", "ja": "その使い方は、正しいのか……？", "zh": "这个字是这么用的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "aecbc54c5852f64d6e52c941733d754709eb568eaa10519edb30e4a420f1b353", "ja": "そして何より、このヒゲをつけていると、\nえらくなった気がします。えっへん。おっほん。", "zh": "而最重要的是，一戴上这副胡子，\n就会觉得自己变伟大了。哼哼，咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "98d92b30834a36719b9c65141fdb8327b6917151f706f6411598981add1375d7", "ja": "衣装にもぴったりで、落ち着いた気分になれます。\n支配人は、男性ですし……大人ですから。", "zh": "跟服装也很搭，让人有种沉着稳重的感受。\n因为经理是男性……也是大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ec204c4f3607b57209d076956f4ef7f711d01428679574d0a2d57361c08ed6ff", "ja": "なるほど……。\n自然な形で、演技に入れるってことだな。", "zh": "原来如此……\n也就是说，能够让你很自然地融入角色对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "f52dfe99a47c228fba8d0609715b9f86b86831fe39bd7fcba2c02babeabc4921", "ja": "はい。このつけヒゲと衣装さえあれば、\n運気も上昇。宝くじも当たって……おや？", "zh": "没错，只要有这副假胡子跟服装，\n就会带来好运，也能中大奖……哎呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1015_p", "source_sha256": "556b0952f9fc65d23ec7f126b257ed0431ffdee292e3406b9c1ba6eeedff15a1", "ja": "いや、そこまではどうかな……。\nでもまあ、瑞希が言いたいことはわかったよ。", "zh": "不，是不是真的有那种效果还很难说……\n不过，我了解瑞希想表达什么了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "68b3a5f2f3c1fee38c92c790d77f1eaa36fd514fd4dde83b01ece3fe2341aab3", "ja": "ありがとうございます。これでようやく、\n{$P$}と肩を並べられるかと。", "zh": "谢谢你，这样一来我终于能够\n跟{$P$}站在对等的立场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "ee821b155d1523df4c529770a6ef848c12d48e51c61efcb04db4f9ac68ac6f34", "ja": "私はいつも、アイドルとして{$P$}に\n背中を押してもらっています。", "zh": "{$P$}总是一直在背后\n推着身为偶像的我前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "6e30ce5b5c745b3dd333b86a670acb305e70a127d31361cee2ccb8d493415746", "ja": "ですが、たまには隣とか。私が、\n{$P$}の後ろに立ってみたいなと。", "zh": "不过，我有时也会想站在\n{$P$}的身边，或是背后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ff45440d16e31720f7a665a1405500a353bb9d8bc30ccbf7970e47a09ff02de6", "ja": "なんだ、そんな事を考えてたのか……。\nいつでも瑞希の好きなところに立ってくれ。", "zh": "怎么，原来你在想这个吗……\n瑞希你随时都可以站在自己想站的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2c6b5f8ff551e95e309338e350ad47235783b669f71194073d73b0be633aee6f", "ja": "プロデューサーとアイドルは、二人三脚だ。\nそれさえ忘れないでいてくれればだけど。", "zh": "制作人跟偶像之间必须像在跑两人三脚一样，相辅相成。\n只要你别忘记这一点就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "29d2bd718c5973b8789be68319702e798ba068e53e09facc8455bf2d902e0695", "ja": "ありがとうございます。……こうして自分の気持ちを\n言うことができたのも、きっと、ヒゲのおかげです。", "zh": "谢谢你……我能像这样诚实说出自己的感受，\n一定也是托了这副胡子的福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4bf8d5d8437b7d6cd495039f1eb0d3c98a58d199509cdb9acd58e87a577e8472", "ja": "そうなのか……？", "zh": "是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "f4a8f7ea6ac178d3423b2ec3b0f2cf98e0d582972e73be126a0a2250bf16230a", "ja": "{$P$}。せっかくなので、\n普段から、この衣装で過ごすというのは……。", "zh": "{$P$}，机会难得，\n干脆平时就让我穿着这套服装生活如何……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1024_p", "source_sha256": "e55b0e86c7b09932caf19b67de21c6bfc2336b721103e9d6a3f34a9ee7546168", "ja": "いや、それはちょっと……。\nさすがに、みんなビックリすると思うし。", "zh": "不，这实在有点……\n而且也会吓到大家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "0cc490d2644e632ca5fe98cba5409545d223e9d9eeb59a989b8510ab8526c16f", "ja": "そうですか。\nなかなか、良い選択かと思ったのですが……。", "zh": "这样啊。\n我本来觉得是个不错的选择……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0104_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "8999a445ad04573085239d0cf0b46b0ab9404aea0b8e82d8ab3caa706e8ba796", "ja": "ヒゲがなくても、いつも……伝えられるように。\n……なれたら、いいな。", "zh": "即使不戴上胡子，也能时常说出真心话……\n若是这样的话该有多好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
